---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Ventures — Krize Kster" description="The ventures and product work of Krize Kster.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Ventures / 02</p>
    <h1 data-parallax="0.04">Different directions. One standard of care.</h1>
    <p>From complex systems to calm consumer tools, each venture is a way of making technology more useful in the real world.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="krizek" class="border-y border-line bg-[#31433a] text-paper">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.8fr] lg:items-end">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-mist">01 / Enterprise systems</p>
          <h2 data-parallax="0.05" class="mt-4 text-[clamp(5rem,13vw,13rem)] font-extrabold leading-[.7] tracking-[-.12em]">KRI<br />ZEK</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed tracking-[-.04em] text-mist">KRI ZEK is the enterprise-facing side of the work: technology strategy, dependable engineering, and systems designed to meet ambitious needs with clarity.</p>
          <a href="https://krizek.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button-light mt-8 border-paper/40 bg-transparent text-paper hover:bg-paper hover:text-ink">Visit krizek.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[1.35rem] border border-paper/20 p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-mist">What it is for</p>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-[.95] tracking-[-.07em]">Complex work deserves a steady hand.</h3>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">A practical partner for businesses that need systems, software, and product decisions to hold up over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.35rem] border border-paper/20 p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-mist">Areas of focus</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-mist">
            <li class="border-b border-paper/15 pb-3">Technology strategy and product direction</li>
            <li class="border-b border-paper/15 pb-3">Reliable digital systems and workflows</li>
            <li>AI-enabled product and operational thinking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="altered-brilliance" class="section-wrap scroll-mt-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-[#d7e0ca] p-8 sm:p-12">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / Consumer products</p>
        <h2 data-parallax="0.04" class="mt-8 text-[clamp(4.2rem,8vw,8rem)] font-extrabold leading-[.78] tracking-[-.11em]">Altered<br />Brilliance</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:pt-12">
        <p class="eyebrow">A product studio</p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.5vw,2rem)] leading-[1.36] tracking-[-.045em] text-ink-soft">A home for consumer experiences that feel lighter, faster, and more useful. The focus is on simple, mobile-first tools that respect people’s attention.</p>
        <a href="https://alteredbrilliance.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button-dark mt-8">Visit Altered Brilliance <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <Card title="Quiet by design" tag="Product principle" subtitle="Less clutter" accent="green">
        <p>Useful experiences do not need to demand attention. Each decision starts with a question: can this be simpler, faster, and easier to return to?</p>
      </Card>
      <Card title="Built for the everyday" tag="Product principle" subtitle="Mobile-first" accent="blue">
        <p>The products live in the moments between everything else — a reason to make the interaction direct, dependable, and genuinely pleasant.</p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
